    <panel_attributes>title=SD03 Extract concepts or generate flashcards
fontsize=14
obj=GUI or CLI~u
obj=AgentFacade~f
obj=ConceptService / FlashcardService~s
obj=LLMClient~l
obj=ResponseParser~p
obj=CourseRepository~r

u-&gt;f : extractConcepts or generateFlashcards(courseId, materialId, count)
f-&gt;s : extractConcepts or generateCards(course, material, count)
s-&gt;l : generate(prompt with actual material chunks)
l.&gt;s : LLMResponse
s-&gt;p : parseConcepts or parseFlashcards(text)
p.&gt;s : proposed objects
s:Validate source IDs and parent links for concepts, remove duplicates and cycles
s:Keep distinct nonempty flashcards, validate count before generation
s-&gt;r : saveCourse(course)
r.&gt;u : actual validated list or explicit failure
s:Generation retries are bounded, failed work does not replace saved results</panel_attributes>
